  "description": "Network ingress for the sandbox KubeVirt VMs (docker-vm, talos-vm), which have wide-open internet access by design. Broken out by source VM and \u2014 as a caveated derived proxy \u2014 by source namespace for in-cluster peers. The opposite direction lives on 'Sandbox VM Egress'. Metrics-only visibility, no alert rules \u2014 alerting stays deferred until an AI triage layer exists.",
